meta {
  name: party
  seq: 1
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

vars:pre-request {
  event_id: 15
  event_token: fdbf1b03-1706-4ff8-8c3b-dbfa52a56e78
}

docs {
  Party flow: pick a preset, preview it with per-event overrides, upload a
  cover image, save the overrides on an existing event, then verify the
  public theme.

  `event_id` / `event_token` above default to a real event seeded in the
  `local` environment (found via `GET /events`, staff). Override them with
  the id/token of an event you own — `events/get event by id.bru` /
  `events/get event by token.bru` in the `events` collection.

  Steps:
    01 - get themes (pick preset)              sets preset_id
    02 - preview party theme                    dry run, no persistence
    03 - create upload url (event cover) [manual]   real Supabase target
    04 - put cover file (signed url) [manual]       needs Bruno Developer Mode
    05 - patch event (theme overrides)          persists cover + confetti
    06 - get public event theme (verify)        public, 5 min cache

  03-04 are manual-only (real Supabase upload + local file), same as
  `contracts-v4 (bookings)/prep-profile` 05-06 — not safe to run unattended.
}
